CB0A 8DF6             (      storage.asm):00011 (6)     CFRDY   bsr     CFWAIT
CB0C 2703             (      storage.asm):00012 (3)             beq     @cfrdy0         Card not busy, proceed
CB0E 1A04             (      storage.asm):00013 (2)             orcc    #ZFLAG
