CB36 8DE8             (      storage.asm):00044 (6)             bsr     CFERRCK
CB38 9750             (      storage.asm):00045 (3)     @cfcise sta     CFERRCD         CF command issue set error
                      (      storage.asm):00046                 IFNE    DEBUG
                      (      storage.asm):00047                 pshs    a,cc
