                      (        forth.asm):02323         * for signed numbers, the way to go is to use circular arithmetic: compute
                      (        forth.asm):02324         * x=(index-limit)+minint, and observe if the addition x+n crosses the boundary
                      (        forth.asm):02325         * between minint and maxint. Many architectures report this through the
                      (        forth.asm):02326         * overflow flag."
